        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "我被蜜蜂“JU”了。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-16-stung-by-a-bee_dialogue_001_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "是哪个“JU”，狙击枪的“狙”还是拘留的“拘”？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-16-stung-by-a-bee_dialogue_002_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "只听说过“蜇”，“被蜜蜂蜇”。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-16-stung-by-a-bee_dialogue_003_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "“JU”是四川话，相当于普通话“蜇”。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-16-stung-by-a-bee_dialogue_004_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "母亲"
        }
      ]
